    old "R-right... Sorry, I guess? I got carried away."
    new "À-phải rồi... Xin lỗi nha? Anh hơi bị tự mãn quá rồi."

    old "Right, because of the taste-testing event. I'll enjoy tasting and the perks of cleaning up left-overs."
